        Application String Resources
        This file contains all user-facing text used throughout the Harmonie Budget
        Tracker application. Using string resources enables internationalization and
        centralizes text management for easier maintenance.

        The file is organized into the following logical sections:
        - Application Metadata (app name, welcome messages, version)
        - Authentication Screens (login, register, forgot password)
        - Budget and Goals (goal setting, budget displays)
        - Category Management (categories, category lists)
        - Expense Management (add expense, expense lists, filtering)
        - Category Totals and Filtering (pie chart, totals, filters)
        - Category Totals Table (table headers, empty state)
        - Budgets Filter Section (category, month, year filters)
        - Budgets Summary (total spent, transaction count)
        - Month Names (January through December for spinners)
        - Gamification (streaks, badges, rewards)
        - More Screen Settings (export, reset, about, help)
        - Navigation (bottom nav labels, screen titles, buttons)
        - Receipt Photo Preview (view receipt, error messages)
        - User Feedback (success messages, greetings)
        - Error Messages (validation errors, authentication errors)
        - Plurals (transaction count)
        - Default Values (placeholder strings)
    -->

